SUMMARY:Tailgate & Touchdowns CASA Heroes Gala and Benefit Auction
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to huddle up for an evening filled with inspiring stories\, exciting auctions\, delicious food\, and championship-worthy fun – all in support of children who deserve safety\, stability\, and a voice.\n\nThis year’s Tailgate & Touchdowns Heroes Gala brings together community champions\, advocates\, and supporters for a high-energy night where every bid\, sponsorship\, and donation helps change a child’s future.\n\nWhether you come dressed in elevated tailgate chic\, your favorite team’s jersey\, your team’s colors\, or classic game-day glam\, prepare for an evening of connection\, celebration\, and purpose. \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Buy Tickets
