SUMMARY:Sparkdate: The Loxley's Social
DESCRIPTION:Looking for a fresh\, low-pressure way to meet single locals in person? Ditch the endless swiping and join us for a modern\, structured dating experience designed to make real connection effortless\, natural\, and actually fun. \n\n\n\nCheck in with your host\, grab a name tag\, and jump right in—no app downloads or last-minute profile setup required. The evening unfolds in three distinct movements: \n\n\n\n\nMovement 1: Guided Icebreakers. Start seated at a small table with an easy game designed to skip the awkward opening lines. Men rotate each round\, ensuring you meet a fresh set of faces with every turn.\n\n\n\nMovement 2: Open Mingling. The formal structure drops away. Move freely\, chat with anyone you like\, and build on conversations you started earlier. Because you’ve already broken the ice with most of the room\, you avoid the cold-approach stress of a standard bar.\n\n\n\nMovement 3: Targeted 1-on-1s. Wrap up the structured portion with focused\, individual conversations with anyone you haven’t sat with yet.\n\n\n\n\nBefore you leave\, privately select anyone you’d like to see again in less than a minute. Matches are mutual\, completely private\, and delivered that same night—no waiting for a prolonged review period. \n\n\n\nEvery person in the room made the intentional effort to show up on a Tuesday night—a real-world filter no dating app can match. \n\n\n\n\nDoors Open: 6:30 PM (21+ with valid ID)\n\n\n\nTickets & Info: sparkdate.date/l/lx-figlancaster\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Buy Tickets
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/sparkdate-the-loxleys-social/
LOCATION:Loxley’s Restaurant\, 500 Centerville Rd\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17601\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community
ORGANIZER;CN="SparkDate":MAILTO:taylor.ancapital@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
