SUMMARY:Beauty of Horror / Horror of Beauty: An Evening with Alma Katsu
DESCRIPTION:Pocket Books is thrilled to invite you to an evening at Zoetropolis exploring the horrific beauty of ‘beauty horror\,’ a subgenre that merges glamour and the grotesque to examine our culture’s obsession with aesthetic perfection.  \n\n\n\nJoin us at 6pm for a talk with horror maven Alma Katsu\, whose new book Incarnate offers a terrifying reimagining of The Picture of Dorian Gray for the internet age. You won’t want to miss our talk\, followed by audience q&a and a book signing. At 7:30pm\, we’ll enjoy a screening of Coralie Fargeat’s celebrated 2024 film The Substance. We will have books available for purchase at the event\, but attendees are encouraged to order in advance! \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Buy Tickets
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/beauty-of-horror-horror-of-beauty-an-evening-with-alma-katsu/
LOCATION:Zoetropolis Cinema Stillhouse\, 112 North Water Street\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Arts & Entertainment
ORGANIZER;CN="Pocket Books Shop":MAILTO:info@pocketbooksshop.com
END:VEVENT
