SUMMARY:Quest for Learning - 50th anniversary
DESCRIPTION:Quest’s Fall 2026 Program begins on Thursday\, September 24th\, and continues every Thursday through October 29th. This fall’s program will celebrate the 50th anniversary of Quest’s founding in September 1976. Each week\, Quest Lancaster will offer educational seminars for intellectually curious lifelong learners on a variety of subjects ranging from history\, science\, world views\, archaeology\, and more.  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
