SUMMARY:Little Terrarium of Terrors: A Happy Hour Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Get into the Halloween spirit at Gallery Grow’s Little Terrarium of Terrors Happy Hour Workshop! Build your own spooky terrarium featuring carnivorous plants\, eerie details\, and a touch of Halloween magic. You’ll learn how to care for these fascinating insect-eating plants and take home a hauntingly fun creation. Each participant will also receive one handmade figurine by local artist Maggie Mowery\, with additional figurines available for purchase during the workshop. \n\n\n\nWhether you’re a longtime plant lover or simply looking for a fun and creative night out\, you’ll leave with a one-of-a-kind terrarium\, new skills\, and a memorable evening of creativity. BYOB and celebrate the spooky season with one of nature’s most captivating plants! \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Buy Tickets
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/little-terrarium-of-terrors-a-happy-hour-workshop/
LOCATION:Gallery Grow\, 320 North Queen Street\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603\, United States
