SUMMARY:Lancaster Capital Day
DESCRIPTION:Join us in Downtown Lancaster for Lancaster Capital Day\, a free family-friendly celebration of local history\, culture\, and community. This festival recognizes Lancaster’s historic role as the nation’s capital on September 27\, 1777\, while exploring the people\, places\, and milestones that have influenced Lancaster County from Pennsylvania’s founding through today. Enjoy live music\, artisan vendors\, local food\, cultural exhibits\, historical demonstrations\, and hands-on activities. There will be something for every age to explore! \n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
