DESCRIPTION:Join the Society of Curious Minds for an afternoon of introspection and philosophical meanderings. – Watch a live 15-minute podcast recording to kick off the event. – Enjoy intimate conversation in small\, rotating groups using over 330 unique prompts. Registration is required. PROVIDED: Wine *glasses\,* coffee\, charcuterie\, and snacks. Guests aged 21+ are welcome to bring their own wine. No outside alcohol will be provided or sold on-site. Parking is first-come first-served. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Register Now
