SUMMARY:Books Books Books 2026
DESCRIPTION:Books Books Books 2026 is a must-attend event for all book lovers! Visit the Wyndham Lancaster Resort and Convention Center for a day filled with literary delights. Immerse yourself in a world of words as you browse through a wide selection of books from various genres. Meet and mingle with fellow bookworms\, authors\, and self-publishers\, and discover new titles to add to your collection. Don’t miss out on this exciting opportunity to celebrate the joy of reading. $5 General Admission. All ticket sales are being donated to a local classroom.  Advance ticket sales gives you a chance to win a $400 gift card. Must be present to win. Free totes are given to the first 400 attendees. Sponsored by: Anna Noel\, Ariel Dawn\, Gia Cobie\, Kristin MacQueen\, Lucia Catherine\, Lydia Michaels\, Mary Walsh\, Megan Ryder\, Sabrina Silvers\, Michael Merson\, Michelle Windsor\, Misty Simon\, Sadie Winchester\, Stacia Mars\, 6 Feet Under Book Bar \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Buy Tickets
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/books-books-books-2026/
